      "sourceTextSha256": "1cdecc94414490d931e061618cd64607c60cb60ef57d982d472914188cfe1b96",
      "text": "Full-day “Gaucho Fiesta” excursion (8 hours) in an English-speaking group, at a traditional Argentine estancia. Discover the way of life and folklore of the gauchos, once nomadic horsemen who settled to farm and raise cattle, and watch them display their remarkable horsemanship and their skill with knives, lassos and boleadoras (ropes weighted with three stones, used to catch cattle). A traditional Argentine lunch of the country’s renowned beef is included.",
