      "sourceTextSha256": "f33bb31e0ff95140f1321c2f72fcba248f93e8a139df5ffa78d798efe4ddcc28",
      "text": "Day 4 · Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the airport and flight to Mendoza, then transfer to your hotel in the city.\n\nOptional activities in Mendoza, at an additional cost: wine-valley tours with tastings, horseback riding, rafting, and visits or treks around Aconcagua, the highest mountain in the Southern Hemisphere (see Optional Excursions).",
